BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Antigravity//Custom Workout Schedule//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Workout Routine (A/B Full Body)
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/Los_Angeles
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:workout-a-20260930T070000@antigravity
DTSTAMP:20260929T192600Z
DTSTART:20260930T070000
DTEND:20260930T081500
SUMMARY:Workout A: Squat & Posterior Chain
DESCRIPTION:==============================\nWORKOUT A: SQUAT & LOWER BACK\n
 ==============================\n\n[WARM-UP (3-5 min)]\n- World's Greatest 
 Stretch: 5/side\n- Deep Squat Hold: 30-45s\n- Band Pull-Aparts: 15-20 reps
 \n\n[MAIN EXERCISES]\n1. Barbell Back Squats\n   * 3 sets x 6-8 reps | Res
 t: 2-3 min\n   * 2-3 light ramp-up sets first\; focus on depth & hip drive
 \n\n2. Flat Barbell or DB Bench Press\n   * 3 sets x 8-10 reps | Rest: 2 m
 in\n   * 1 feeler set\; retract scapulae\, control eccentric\n\n3. Chest-S
 upported Row (Incline DB or Machine)\n   * 3 sets x 8-10 reps | Rest: 90 s
 ec\n   * Keeps lower back 100% fresh for RDLs\n\n4. Romanian Deadlifts (RD
 Ls)\n   * 3 sets x 8-10 reps | Rest: 90 sec\n   * Heavy barbell or DB hing
 e\; stretch glutes & hamstrings\n\n5. Weighted 45 deg Back Extensions (Rom
 an Chair)\n   * 2-3 sets x 12-15 reps | Rest: 60-90 sec\n   * Direct lower
  back hypertrophy\; squeeze glutes at top\n\n6. Hanging Knee / Leg Raises\
 n   * 3 sets x 10-15 reps | Rest: 60 sec\n   * Strict form\; decompresses 
 spine after heavy loads\n\n7. Cable Face Pulls\n   * 3 sets x 15-20 reps |
  Rest: 60 sec\n   * High pulley to eye level\; external shoulder rotation\
 n\n------------------------------\nNutrition Target: ~190-210g protein | 3
 .5-4L water
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:workout-b-20261002T070000@antigravity
DTSTAMP:20260929T192600Z
DTSTART:20261002T070000
DTEND:20261002T081500
SUMMARY:Workout B: Deadlift & Vertical Focus
DESCRIPTION:==============================\nWORKOUT B: HINGE & VERTICAL FOC
 US\n==============================\n\n[WARM-UP (3-5 min)]\n- World's Great
 est Stretch: 5/side\n- Deep Squat Hold: 30-45s\n- Band Pull-Aparts: 15-20 
 reps\n\n[MAIN EXERCISES]\n1. Conventional Barbell Deadlift\n   * 3 sets x 
 5 reps | Rest: 2-3 min\n   * 2-3 ramp-up sets\; pull from dead stop\; rese
 t brace each rep\n\n2. Standing Overhead Press (Barbell or DB)\n   * 3 set
 s x 6-8 reps | Rest: 2 min\n   * 1 feeler set\; squeeze glutes & brace cor
 e tightly\n\n3. Neutral-Grip Lat Pulldown\n   * 3 sets x 8-10 reps | Rest:
  90 sec\n   * Full stretch\; elbow-friendly alternative to 245 lb pull-ups
 \n\n4. Incline DB Bench Press (30 deg angle)\n   * 3 sets x 8-10 reps | Re
 st: 90 sec\n   * Upper chest focus\; control 2-3s negative\n\n5. Leg Press
  or Bulgarian Split Squats\n   * 3 sets x 10-12 reps | Rest: 90 sec\n   * 
 Quad finisher with zero axial spinal compression\n\n6. Cable Face Pulls\n 
   * 3 sets x 15-20 reps | Rest: 60 sec\n   * Shoulder joint longevity & ro
 tator cuff stability\n\n7. Hammer Curls\n   * 2 sets x 10-12 reps | Rest: 
 60 sec\n   * Strict form\; protects forearms for drumming days\n\n8. Decli
 ne or Cable Crunches\n   * 3 sets x 15-20 reps | Rest: 60 sec\n   * Spine 
 flexion focus\; 1-sec squeeze at contraction\n\n--------------------------
 ----\nNutrition Target: ~190-210g protein | 3.5-4L water
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
